=== For rank to drop when removing one TT constraint ===
Need: for EVERY d ∉ {a,b,c}, at least one of
  {a,b,d}, {a,c,d}, {b,c,d} is cyclic.
This means d cannot be 'fully transitive' with all pairs from {a,b,c}.


