=== Out-neighbor tournament structure ===
For transitive tournament on n vertices, vertex 0:
  Out-neighbors: {1, 2, ..., n-1}
  Induced tournament: transitive on n-1 vertices
  Propagation chain: h(0,1) → h(0,2) → ... → h(0,n-1)
  Length: n-2 steps

For random tournament, vertex v with d+ out-neighbors:
  Induced tournament is random on d+ vertices
  Expected diameter: 2 (for d+ ≥ 4)
  Propagation reaches all v-edges in ~2 steps

